er a final dividend.\nInvestor call scheduled on May 8, 2026, to discuss results and strategy; trading window closed till 48 hours post-results.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=03bf3f1a-02a0-4832-9400-9dd368d091de.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-27T15:19:20","source":"BSE"},{"id":"260223159343221","title":"Route Mobile's Dec 2025 net sales dropped 9.9% Y-o-Y to Rs 185.9 cr; net profit rose 4.6% to Rs 30.4 cr.\nEBITDA grew 3.6% to Rs 44.5 cr; EPS increased to Rs 4.82 from Rs 4.61; shares closed at Rs 514.75 on Feb 19, 2026.","summary":"Route Mobile's Dec 2025 net sales dropped 9.9% Y-o-Y to Rs 185.9 cr; net profit rose 4.6% to Rs 30.4 cr.\nEBITDA grew 3.6% to Rs 44.5 cr; EPS increased to Rs 4.82 from Rs 4.61; shares closed at Rs 514.75 on Feb 19, 2026.","url":"https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/earnings/route-standalone-december-2025-net-sales-at-rs-185-94-crore-down-9-86-y-o-y-13839778.html","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-23T14:00:29","source":"Moneycontrol"},{"id":"811495347200585344","title":"Route Mobile appoints new CEO with telecom sales expertise. Q3 revenue slightly down YoY due to ILD business decline.\nGross profit margin up 340 bps YoY with a shift to higher-margin segments; steady PAT margins amid ongoing investments.","summary":"Route Mobile appoints new CEO with telecom sales expertise. Q3 revenue slightly down YoY due to ILD business decline.\nGross profit margin up 340 bps YoY with a shift to higher-margin segments; steady PAT margins amid ongoing investments.","url":"https://sqst.in/8UdnR","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-17T12:42:47","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"501298","title":"Route Mobile Ltd shared its Q3 FY26 earnings call transcript, highlighting a leadership change with Tushar Agnihotri assuming the CEO role. The transition aims to enhance execution and growth focus.\nThe company reported improved gross margins at 24.5% due to a strategic shift to higher-margin domestic and regional businesses, despite a slight revenue decline from lower-margin international messaging.","summary":"Route Mobile Ltd shared its Q3 FY26 earnings call transcript, highlighting a leadership change with Tushar Agnihotri assuming the CEO role. The transition aims to enhance execution and growth focus.\nThe company reported improved gross margins at 24.5% due to a strategic shift to higher-margin domestic and regional businesses, despite a slight revenue decline from lower-margin international messaging.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=55145c84-0111-48d3-8974-a62187833c8e.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-17T12:41:21","source":"BSE"},{"id":"808751487333940224","title":"Route Mobile reported Q3 & 9M FY25-26 revenue of 44,523 mn, EBITDA 5,237 mn LTM.\nBoard announced Rs.3/share interim dividend; focus remains on WhatsApp solutions and global clients.","summary":"Route Mobile reported Q3 & 9M FY25-26 revenue of 44,523 mn, EBITDA 5,237 mn LTM.\nBoard announced Rs.3/share interim dividend; focus remains on WhatsApp solutions and global clients.","url":"https://sqst.in/kQcHG","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-09T22:59:40","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"808750614918708352","title":"Route Mobile's Q3FY26 revenue dipped to ₹1107.06 cr from ₹1183.79 cr YoY.\nPAT rose to ₹102.56 cr from ₹85.47 cr YoY; profit margins improved.","summary":"Route Mobile's Q3FY26 revenue dipped to ₹1107.06 cr from ₹1183.79 cr YoY.\nPAT rose to ₹102.56 cr from ₹85.47 cr YoY; profit margins improved.","url":"https://sqst.in/HroB8","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-09T22:56:12","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"481394","title":"Route Mobile's board approved Rs. 3 interim dividend per share for FY26, with a record date of February 13, 2026.\nCEO role transitions as Mr. Rajdipkumar Gupta becomes MD, and Mr. Tushar Agnihotri is appointed as new CEO to drive growth.","summary":"Route Mobile's board approved Rs. 3 interim dividend per share for FY26, with a record date of Februa