 and Additional Non-Executive Director effective Jan 22, 2026.\nMark James Reid resigns as Chairman citing personal commitments; board committees reconstituted accordingly.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5b5a38fb-1652-4f05-a829-2a6a1a570e03.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-23T11:38:09","source":"BSE"},{"id":"414911","title":"Route Mobile Ltd allotted 5,500 equity shares under RML ESOP 2017, raising paid-up capital to Rs. 63.0 Cr.\n3,000 stock options under RML ESOP 2021 were canceled due to employee cessation; details available on the company's website.","summary":"Route Mobile Ltd allotted 5,500 equity shares under RML ESOP 2017, raising paid-up capital to Rs. 63.0 Cr.\n3,000 stock options under RML ESOP 2021 were canceled due to employee cessation; details available on the company's website.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4f31bc88-39cf-4952-8c1c-542ea4ffa0b0.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2025-12-18T21:00:14","source":"BSE"},{"id":"788347598828505728","title":"Route Mobile Ltd announces the cancellation of ESOPs.","summary":"Route Mobile Ltd announces the cancellation of ESOPs.","url":"https://sqst.in/vir4r","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2025-12-15T15:41:54","source":"ScoutQuest"}]}]